xl:px-0"><h2 class="mb-4.5 font-satoshi text-3xl font-bold -tracking-[1.6px] text-black dark:text-white lg:text-heading-4 xl:text-heading-2">Frequently Ask Questions</h2><p class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[585px] dark:text-gray-4"></p></div><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[662px] px-4 sm:px-8 xl:px-0"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 "><div class="rounded-lg bg-white shadow-1 dark:bg-gray-dark"><button class="text-medium flex w-full items-center justify-between px-6 py-4 text-left text-lg text-dark dark:text-white md:text-xl">What is FLUX AI?<span class="duration-300 rotate-180"><svg width="24" height="25" viewBox="0 0 24 25" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M4.43057 8.87618C4.70014 8.56168 5.17361 8.52526 5.48811 8.79483L12 14.3765L18.5119 8.79483C18.8264 8.52526 19.2999 8.56168 19.5695 8.87618C19.839 9.19067 19.8026 9.66415 19.4881 9.93371L12.4881 15.9337C12.2072 16.1745 11.7928 16.1745 11.5119 15.9337L4.51192 9.93371C4.19743 9.66415 4.161 9.19067 4.43057 8.87618Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></button><div class="grid" style="grid-template-rows:1fr;transition:grid-template-rows 300ms"><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300"><p class="border-t border-stroke px-6 py-7 dark:border-stroke-dark">FLUX AI is an advanced image generation model that creates stunning visuals.</p></div></div></div><div class="rounded-lg bg-white shadow-1 dark:bg-gray-dark"><button class="text-medium flex w-full items-center justify-between px-6 py-4 text-left text-lg text-dark dark:text-white md:text-xl">Can I try your FLUX AI service for free?<span class="duration-300 "><svg width="24" height="25" viewBox="0 0 24 25" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M4.43057 8.87618C4.70014 8.56168 5.17361 8.52526 5.48811 8.79483L12 14.3765L18.5119 8.79483C18.8264 8.52526 19.2999 8.56168 19.5695 8.87618C19.839 9.19067 19.8026 9.66415 19.4881 9.93371L12.4881 1