mage to Prompt\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"dark:text-gray-5\",\"children\":\"Image to Prompt is a powerful tool that analyzes images and generates detailed text descriptions. Working seamlessly with FLUX AI. Prompt: A cat wearing a suit and tie with green eyes, a stock photo by Hanns Katz, pexels, furry art, stockphoto, creative commons attribution, quantum wavetracing.\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-7.5 flex flex-col gap-3\",\"children\":[]}],\"$L26\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full max-w-[484px]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-xl\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",null,{\"src\":\"/images/features-img/features-image-to-prompt.webp\",\"alt\":\"Image to Prompt\",\"width\":484,\"height\":400}]}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-10 pt-17.5 sm:flex-row-reverse lg:pt-22.5 xl:pt-27.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full max-w-[475px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-4.5 font-satoshi text-2xl font-bold text-black dark:text-white lg:text-3xl xl:text-heading-4\",\"children\":\"Background Remover\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"dark:text-gray-5\",\"children\":\"Background Remover is an efficient tool that allows you to quickly remove backgrounds from images generated by FLUX AI. Itseamlessly isolates subjects, making it ideal for creating clean, professional visuals. Whether for e-commerce, design, or personal projects, this tool saves time and enhances image quality with precision and ease.\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-7.5 flex flex-col gap-3\",\"children\":[]}],\"$L27\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full max-w-[484px]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-xl\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",null,{\"src\":\"/images/features-img/features-background-remover.webp\",\"alt\":\"Background Remover\",\"width\":484,\"heigh