,\"children\":\"Try it now\"}]}]\n2a:[\"$\",\"$L2e\",null,{\"locale\":\"en\",\"localePrefixMode\":\"always\",\"prefix\":\"/en\",\"href\":\"/auth/signup\",\"className\":\"mt-7.5 inline-flex rounded-full bg-white px-7 py-3 font-satoshi font-medium -tracking-[0.2px] text-black hover:bg-opacity-90\",\"rel\":\"nofollow\",\"children\":\"Get FLUX AI\"}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"2c:[\"$\",\"$L2f\",null,{\"locale\":\"en\",\"now\":\"$D2025-12-08T16:05:33.671Z\",\"timeZone\":\"UTC\",\"messages\":{\"components\":{\"Home\":{\"Hero\":{\"h1\":\"FLUX AI\",\"p\":\"Unlock the power of Flux AI with Black Forest Labs. Our Flux AI Image Generator transforms your creative ideas into stunning visuals, delivering unmatched quality and innovation with every image.\",\"a\":\"Get Started for Free\",\"hero-1-alt\":\"flux ai image generator - A machine generating endless of polaroid images and blowing them up into the air. Realistic National geographic photo\",\"hero-2-alt\":\"flux ai image generator - macro photography of a miniature little village on top of a flower\",\"hero-3-alt\":\"flux ai image generator - filmic photo of a group of three women on a street downtown, they are holding their hands up the camera\",\"hero-4-alt\":\"flux ai image generator - detailed pen and ink drawing with watercolor infill of a large beautiful castle on a hill above a forest, pastel colored clouds rolling by overhead, a knight on a horse can be seen riding up the winding path to the castle\",\"hero-5-alt\":\"flux ai image generator - thick splotchy oil painting with brush strokes of a large whale floating gently in the night sky high above a city\"},\"Gallery\":{\"sectionHeader\":\"FLUX AI Art\",\"gallery-1-alt\":\"flux ai image generator - A hidden cenote in the heart of a lush jungle beckons with crystalline turquoise waters. Vibrant emerald vines cascade down weathered limestone walls, their tendrils barely kissing the water’s surface. Shafts of golden sunlight pierce through a natural skylight above, creating a mystical interplay of light and shadow on the cavern walls. Iridescent butterflies flit between exotic orchids clinging to rocky outcrops. A partially submerged Mayan ruin, its intricate carvings softened by time, stands as a silent sentinel at the water’s edge. Schools of tiny silver fish dart through the crystal-clear depths, their scales glinting like underwater stars. At the far end of the cenote, a small waterfall tumbles melodiously into the pool, its mist creating ephemeral rainbows in the dappled light.\",\"gallery-2-alt\":\"flux ai image generator - minimalist geometric vector art style poster\",\"gallery-3-alt\":\"flux ai image generator - beautiful anime artwork, a cute anime catgirl that looks depressed holding a piece of paper with a smile drawn on it over her mouth, she is about to cry\",\"gallery-4-alt\":\"flux ai image generator - a tiny astronaut hatching from an egg on the moon\",\"gallery-5-alt\":\"flux ai image generator - a large skyscraper in a cyberpunk city\",\"gallery-6-alt\":\"flux ai image generator - donut jesus hybrid mythical creature\",\"gallery-7-alt\":\"flux ai image generator - old man with glasses portrait, photo, 50mm, f1.4, natural light, Pathéchrome\",\"gallery-8-alt\":\"flux ai image generator - professional photograph of a lynx lit by moody harsh lighting in the middle of a forest\",\"gallery-9-alt\":\"flux ai image generator - beautiful anime artwork, a cute anime girl’s silhouette, double exposure, iridescent nebula galaxy, black background, ethereal glow, bloom, hdr\",\"gallery-10-alt\":\"flux ai image generator - abstract chrome 80s scifi automaton, airbrush\",\"gallery-11-alt\":\"flux ai image generator - a mad scientist building a massive huge unbelievable queue that reaches from the office desk all the way into space where it touches the moon\",\"gallery-12-alt\":\"flux ai image generator - a photo of a beautiful street in Freiburg with a tram passing by and people walking about and riding bikes\"},\"Features\":{\"sectionHeader\":{\"title\":\"FLUX AI Features\"},\"data\":{\"1\":{\"title\":\"FLUX AI Image Generator\",\"description\":\"The Flux AI Image Generator leverages the advanced FLUX AI model to create high-quality visuals. With options like FLUX.1 Dev, FLUX.1 Schnell, FLUX.1 Pro, FLUX 1.1 Pro and FLUX 1.1 Pro Ultra, some models are available for free use.\"},\"2\":{\"title\":\"AI Image Editor\",\"description\":\"The AI Image Editor enhances your FLUX AI experience with features like prompt optimization, image to prompt, background remover, image enhancer, and image restore. Some tools are available free online, perfectly complementing the image generation capabilities of FLUX AI.\"},\"3\":{\"title\":\"Free Storage\",\"description\":\"All generated images by FLUX AI will be saved for you in the cloud for free, and you can manage them anytime.\"}}},\"FeatureWithImg\":{\"sectionHeader\":{\"title\":\"One-stop AI Image Solution\",\"description\":\"\"},\"data\":{\"1\":{\"title\":\"FLUX.1 Schnell\",\"description\":\"FLUX.1 Schnell is the fastest image generation model, specifically designed for local development and personal use. As a free AI art generator, FLUX AI offers incredible speed and efficiency, enabling users to quickly generate high-quality images from text descriptions. With FLUX AI, both speed and precision are guaranteed, providing a robust solution for creative workflows.\",\"checklist\":\"text-to-image\"},\"2\":{\"title\":\"FLUX.1 Dev\",\"description\":\"FLUX.1 Dev is an AI picture generator powered by FLUX AI, using a 12 billion parameter rectified flow transformer to create images from text descriptions. FLUX AI enables users to quickly turn prompts into high-quality visuals, making it a powerful tool for both developers and artists seeking precision and creativity.\",\"checklist\":\"text-to-image,image-to-image\"},\"3\":{\"title\":\"FLUX.1 Pro\",\"description\":\"FLUX.1 Pro is a state-of-the-art AI photo generator, offering top-of-the-line prompt following, visual quality, image detail, and output diversity. Powered by FLUX AI, it turns text descriptions into stunning visuals, ensuring unmatched precision and creativity in every generated image. Ideal for developers and digital artists seeking advanced capabilities.\",\"checklist\":\"text-to-image,image-to-image\"},\"4\":{\"title\":\"FLUX1.1 Pro\",\"description\":\"FLUX1.1 Pro is an upgraded version of FLUX.1 Pro, bringing faster processing, enhanced image quality, and even greater diversity in output. This advanced text-to-image model, powered by FLUX AI, produces precise and visually striking results.\",\"checklist\":\"text-to-image,image-to-image\"},\"5\":{\"title\":\"FLUX1.1 Pro Ultra\",\"description\":\"FLUX1.1 Pro Ultra is an advanced AI image generator from text, delivering images up to 4 megapixels in resolution. With its raw mode, users can achieve unmatched realism, making it perfect for creating highly detailed and lifelike visuals. Powered by FLUX AI, it ensures precision, clarity, and stunning output for creative professionals.\",\"checklist\":\"text-to-image,image-to-image\"},\"6\":{\"title\":\"Prompt Optimization\",\"description\":\"Prompt Optimization enhances your text prompts to achieve the best possible image generation with FLUX AI. By refining inputs for clarity and detail, it ensures the generated visuals are more accurate and aligned with your vision. This tool maximizes the potential of FLUX AI, delivering high-quality results for artists and developers alike.\"},\"7\":{\"title\":\"Image to Prompt\",\"description\":\"Image to Prompt is a powerful tool that analyzes images and generates detailed text descriptions. Working seamlessly with FLUX AI. Prompt: A cat wearing a suit and tie with green eyes, a stock photo by Hanns Katz, pexels, furry art, stockphoto, creative commons attribution, quantum wavetracing.\"},\"8\":{\"title\":\"Background Remover\",\"description\":\"Background Remover is an efficient tool that allows you to quickly remove backgrounds from images generated by FLUX AI. Itseamlessly isolates subjects, making it ideal for creating clean, professional visuals. Whether for e-commerce, design, or personal projects, this tool saves time and enhances image quality with precision and ease.\"},\"9\":{\"title\":\"Image Enhancer\",\"description\":\"Image Enhancer is designed to improve image quality with advanced algorithms. It sharpens details, adjusts colors, and enhances clarity, providing stunning, high-resolution results. Perfect for users who want to elevate their images for professional use or creative projects, this tool ensures optimal visual quality in just a few steps.It works better with FLUX AI.\"},\"10\":{\"title\":\"Image Restore\",\"description\":\"Image Restore is a powerful tool that revitalizes old or damaged images. Using advanced AI, it repairs and enhances details, removes noise, and restores clarity to faded photos. Perfect for recovering memories or improving historical images, this tool ensures your visuals look as sharp and vibrant as they originally were.It works better with FLUX AI.\"}},\"FeatureItem\":{\"button\":\"Try it now\"}},\"HowToUse\":{\"sectionHeader\":{\"title\":\"FLUX AI How To Use\"},\"data\":{\"1\":{\"name\":\"Fill out the form\"},\"2\":{\"name\":\"Generate\"},\"3\":{\"name\":\"View result\"}}},\"Counter\":{\"h2\":\"Numbers speaking for themselves\",\"p-1\":\"FLUX AI Users\",\"p-2\":\"FLUX AI Images\"},\"CallToAction\":{\"h2\":\"Get started today\",\"p\":\"FLUX AI Dream is Just a Click Away – Embark on Your FLUX AI Journey Today\",\"a\":\"Get FLUX AI\"},\"Testimonials\":{\"sectionHeader\":{\"title\":\"FLUX AI - Loved by businesses worldwide\"},\"data\":{\"0\":{\"1\":{\"name\":\"Ethan Miller\",\"role\":\"\",\"text\":\"FLUX AI has revolutionized my creative process. The speed and precision of image generation are unmatched. Whether I’m working on personal projects or professional designs, FLUX AI delivers high-quality results every time, making it a must-have tool for any artist.\"},\"2\":{\"name\":\"Benjamin Carter\",\"role\":\"\",\"text\":\"I was amazed at how quickly FLUX AI produces stunning images from text prompts. The tool is incredibly easy to use and consistently delivers beautiful visuals.\"}},\"1\":{\"1\":{\"name\":\"Emily Johnson\",\"role\":\"\",\"text\":\"As a content creator, I’m constantly amazed by the capabilities of FLUX AI. The image generation of FLUX AI is lightning fast, and the results are incredibly detailed.\"},\"2\":{\"name\":\"Matthew Davis\",\"role\":\"\",\"text\":\"FLUX AI has quickly become my go-to tool for image creation. It’s user-friendly, fast, and always generates high-quality results. Whether I’m creating digital art or enhancing existing images, FLUX AI always provides an efficient and professional solution.\"}},\"2\":{\"1\":{\"name\":\"Alexander Thompson\",\"role\":\"\",\"text\":\"Having tried other models like DALL·E and MidJourney, I can confidently say FLUX AI is a game-changer. FLUX AI generates images with superior detail and accuracy, especially when following complex prompts.\"},\"2\":{\"name\":\"Noah Wilson\",\"role\":\"\",\"text\":\"I’ve been using FLUX AI for various projects, and it’s been a game-changer. The quality of images is consistently amazing, and it saves me so much time. I’m able to turn my ideas into reality effortlessly, thanks to the powerful text-to-image generation of FLUX AI.\"}}}},\"FAQ\":{\"sectionHeader\":{\"title\":\"Frequently Ask Questions\"},\"data\":{\"1\":{\"question\":\"What is FLUX AI?\",\"answer\":\"FLUX AI is an advanced image generation model that creates stunning visuals.\"},\"3\":{\"question\":\"Can I try your FLUX AI service for free?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, we offer a free plan with limited usage. If you have run out of all your credits, please subscribe or upgrade your plan to get more credits.\"},\"6\":{\"question\":\"Can I change my plan later?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, you can upgrade or downgrade at any time.\"},\"7\":{\"question\":\"Can I cancel my plan?\",\"answer\":\"If you no longer wish to use, you can cancel your subscription anytime. When canceled, you will still be able to use your credits for the remaining of the current billing cycle.\"},\"8\":{\"question\":\"Will my unused credits roll over to the next month?\",\"answer\":\"Plan's credits do not roll over to the next month.\"},\"9\":{\"question\":\"What's the refund policy?\",\"answer\":\"Due to the nature of this being a digital product, we are unable to offer refunds.\"}}},\"Brand\":{\"sectionHeader\":{\"title\":\"Featured On\"}}},\"Auth\":{\"Signin\":{\"GoogleSigninButton\":\"Sign in with Google\",\"or\":\"OR\",\"passwordButton\":\"Password\",\"noAccountTips\":\"Do not have an account yet?\",\"createAccount\":\"Create account →\",\"SigninWithPassword\":{\"emailInput\":\"Email\",\"passwordInput\":\"Password\",\"rememberMe\":\"Remember me\",\"forgotPassword\":\"Forgot Password?\",\"signinButton\":\"Sign In\"}},\"Signup\":{\"GoogleSigninButton\":\"Sign up with Google\",\"or\":\"OR\",\"emailButton\":\"Email\",\"alreadyAccountTips\":\"Already have an account?\",\"signIn\":\"Sign In →\",\"SignupWithPassword\":{\"nameInput\":\"Name\",\"emailInput\":\"Email\",\"passwordInput\":\"Password\",\"signupButton\":\"Sign Up\"}}},\"User\":{\"AccountSettings\":{\"EditProfile\":{\"h3\":\"Edit Profile\",\"nameInputGroupLabel\":\"Your Name\",\"nameInputGroupPlaceholder\":\"Enter Your Name\",\"formButtonSaving\":\"Saving\",\"formButtonSave\":\"Save Changes\"}},\"Billing\":{\"totalCredits\":\"total credits\",\"remainingCredits\":\"remaining credits\"}},\"Header\":{\"nav\":{\"1\":{\"title\":\"Video AI\",\"tip\":\"Veo 3\",\"submenu\":{\"11\":{\"title\":\"Veo 3\"}}},\"2\":{\"title\":\"Image AI\",\"submenu\":{\"2\":{\"title\":\"FLUX.1 Dev\"},\"3\":{\"title\":\"FLUX.1 Pro\"},\"4\":{\"title\":\"FLUX1.1 Pro\"},\"21\":{\"title\":\"FLUX.1 Schnell\"},\"25\":{\"title\":\"FLUX1.1 Pro Ultra\"}}},\"4\":{\"title\":\"Image Magic\",\"tip\":\"Ghibli Filter\",\"